&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Technical Program Manager on our Hardware team, you will support NPI programs and a wide range of manufacturing efforts on the ground in Asia. In this role, you’ll partner closely with EPM, EE, ME and Design resources in both our US and Taipei offices, and a wide network of JDMs. While managing build readiness and FATP prep to validation and certification troubleshooting, your primary responsibility will be manufacturing test definition and test deployment to move our products forward to a successful launch. Verkada TPMs must be ready to get hands-on and leverage deep technical expertise to hold vendors accountable, clear program hurdles, and help the team drive from prototype to production. This is a full-time, in-person role based in our Taipei, Taiwan office.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee key EVT, DVT and PVT build milestones at our JDM R&amp;amp;D and factory facilities. Leverage your engineering expertise to de-risk NPI builds and expedite technical troubleshooting independently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own manufacturing readiness, line bring up, and FATP problem solving for a complex set of electromechanical products within one of Verkada’s newest product lines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide material readiness, fixture/jig readiness, and other clear to build efforts in advance of FATP. Coordinate between JDM manufacturing partners and internal firmware team to assess FATP flow, test coverage, fixture/equipment plans and associated test limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with EE, ME and FW teammates (in both the US and Taiwan) to solve a variety of end to end NPI challenges from early design development efforts to later stage validation &amp;amp; compliance challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with EPM teammates to drive vendors towards aggressive schedules and ambitious objectives; hold our manufacturing partners accountable &amp;amp; communicate status updates clearly to EPM counterparts &amp;amp; the broader team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key point of contact for an international network of manufacturing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S. in Electrical Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge of electromechanical design, validation and manufacturing test and test fixture development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing and manufacturing new electronics products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct exposure to manufacturing of audio &amp;amp; video related products is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have completed at least two full hardware development cycles through product launch with direct (in person) exposure to FATP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills and written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both Mandarin and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and adaptive in a fast-paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally up to 30%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taiwan Employee Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is committed to fostering a workplace environment that prioritizes the holistic health and wellbeing of our employees and their families by offering comprehensive wellness perks, benefits, and resources. Our benefits and perks programs include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance by Nan Shan Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent employees of Verkada Taiwan are eligible for full participation to the group insurance scheme, including accidental death and dismemberment, critical illness, accident medical reimbursement, hospital and surgical, and cancer indemnity cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spouses and immediate dependents are eligible to participate in the scheme for accident medical reimbursement, hospital and surgical, and cancer indemnity cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave policy &amp;amp; fertility benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to relax and recharge through our paid holidays, firmwide extended holidays, flexible PTO and personal sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness/fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be independently authorized to work in Taiwan. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment visa for this role, at this time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verkada Is An Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Verkada is committed to providing employment opportunities to all individuals. All applicants for positions at Verkada will be treated without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, age, marital status, veteran status, pregnancy, or any other basis prohibited by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.verkada.com/privacy/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/E_spClO3Ac9pX43h9dXa8/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1719327847319000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw10eB41dX5dzNP9yveIJLsf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

firstmark-cockroach-labs:greenhouse:7982.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;job-post-container&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; background-color: white; padding: 20px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); min-height: 500px; border: 5px solid #0037A5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 2; width: 200px; height: 300px; margin-top: 30px; opacity: 1; z-index: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-post-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%; float: left;&quot; src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/b9m4CJj.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;92&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Category-defining tech. Career-defining work.&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;The next era of software won’t operate at human scale. Applications will create applications. Systems will coordinate with systems. Data and decisions will move faster than teams can react to them. The infrastructure powering that world cannot be fragile, reactive, or limited by the assumptions of the past.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Cockroach Labs exists to build what comes next — before the world requires it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;We created CockroachDB to survive failures, scale without compromise, and adapt to changing conditions automatically. Now we’re helping define a future where complexity fades into the background and infrastructure simply works, no matter the scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;This is the kind of challenge that attracts people who want to shape industries, not just participate in them. The work is ambitious, the standards are high, and the impact is real.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Value Engineer at Cockroach Labs is a strategic advisor embedded within our Solution Engineering organization, working directly with Account Executives, Sales Engineers, and Customer Success Managers to quantify and communicate the financial impact of adopting CockroachDB. You&#39;ll engage directly with customer IT Directors, CTOs, CFOs, and other senior executives, designing and delivering custom Return on Investment (ROI) and Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) models that translate complex technical advantages into compelling financial narratives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility, high-impact role that sits at the intersection of finance, technology, and consultative sales. You&#39;ll help customers across banking, payments, gaming, retail, and high technology make confident, data-driven decisions about their infrastructure investment, and you&#39;ll help build the Value Engineering practice at Cockroach Labs from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROI and TCO Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deliver custom, bottoms-up financial models that quantify the business value of migrating to or standardizing on CockroachDB. Models will account for infrastructure spend, operational overhead, licensing, developer productivity, and risk mitigation, calibrated to each customer&#39;s actual environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive-Level Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead whiteboard sessions, executive presentations, and boardroom discussions that translate CockroachDB&#39;s technical advantages into financial narratives tied to P&amp;amp;L impact, capital efficiency, and long-term competitive advantage. Your audience is both the CFO and the CTO; you have to be credible with both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct meaningful discovery with senior customer stakeholders to understand how their current database landscape (legacy RDBMS, NoSQL, or managed cloud) is creating cost drag, operational fragility, or scalability constraints, and how CockroachDB addresses those challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain the Value Engineering practice: customer discovery guides, technical-to-business pain taxonomy, ROI/TCO templates, champion decks, and win stories. Enable the broader SE and AE teams to apply the framework confidently and independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Attend Global Evaluation Pit Stops to coach and validate business cases for active opportunities. Partner closely with Sales Engineers and Account Executives to accelerate deal velocity and expand strategic accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a conduit between customer conversations and the Product organization, synthesizing patterns in TCO and ROI discussions to provide direct input to the product roadmap and help shape the compelling database economics that can be unlocked through product enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In your first 6 months&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an engagement strategy and collaboration model with field teams (AEs, SEs, CSMs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the foundation of the Value Engineering practice: customer discovery guides, TCO/ROI templates, pain-to-value taxonomy, and champion decks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce at least one piece of Value Engineering thought leadership for external publication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the broader field on Value Engineering methodology and early customer win stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend Global Evaluation Pit Stops and begin contributing to live deal business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In your first year&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full Value Engineering motion, from customer discovery through executive presentation and deal close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Cockroach Labs as a credible voice on database TCO and infrastructure economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a repeatable, scalable playbook that the broader field team can leverage independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningful product feedback based on patterns from customer ROI and TCO conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in value engineering, financial consulting, technology consulting, or a related field, ideally in enterprise software, SaaS, or cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling skills: bottoms-up cost analysis, ROI/NPV frameworks, and IT portfolio economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency sufficient to engage in substantive discovery with engineering and infrastructure leaders; familiarity with database architecture, distributed systems, or cloud cost structures is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead executive-level presentations and translate complex technical concepts into financial narratives that drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a consultative capacity alongside enterprise sales and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polished written and verbal communication skills; equally comfortable in a boardroom and a working session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated practice of integrating AI tools into your daily workflow to improve speed, quality, and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI across core tasks (research, drafting, analysis, planning) used as a default, not an exception&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset: this is a practice-building role. You&#39;ll create the playbook, not follow one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cockroach Labs is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer building a diverse and inclusive workforce. If you need additional accommodations to feel comfortable during your interview process, please email us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accessibility@cockroachlabs.com&quot;&gt;accessibility@cockroachlabs.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cockroach Labs has a hybrid work model, with Roachers that are local to one of our offices coming in on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Thursdays and working flexibly the rest of the week. While we’ve learned valuable lessons working remotely, nothing can replace the connection, creativity, and fun that occurs when Roachers get together and we are committed to fostering a workplace that encourages collaboration and allows us all to do our best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Benefits&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development Funds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Sick Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual anticipated base salary range for U.S. candidates for this role is listed in USD below. This role is also eligible for commission. Salary is one component of the Cockroach Labs’ Total Rewards package, which also includes, for each employee: stock options, medical insurance, vision insurance, dental insurance, life and disability insurance, funds towards professional development resources, flexible paid time off, 11 paid holidays a year, 10 paid sick days a year, paid parental leave, a 401(k) plan, and wellbeing benefits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We set standard ranges for all U.S.-based roles based on function, level, and geographic location, benchmarked against similar stage growth companies. Actual salaries may vary and fall outside of this range depending on factors such as a candidate’s qualifications, geographic location, skills, experience, and competencies. In addition, we are often open to a wide variety of profiles, and recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salaries for candidates outside the U.S. will vary based on local compensation structures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will remain posted until filled. Applicants should apply via our Careers Page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Anticipated Base Salary Range (U.S)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$145,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$190,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

foothillventures-amperesand:greenhouse:4.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Overview&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;157&quot;&gt;Amperesand is reinventing how the world powers its most critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;We are facing a once-in-a-generation opportunity for infrastructure disruption. Electricity demand is skyrocketing, driven by AI factories, electric vehicles, and modern industrial growth. Energy supply is shifting to incorporate a more diverse mix of resources – including solar, gas, and batteries – at a massive scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;858&quot;&gt;And yet the power infrastructure behind our latest mega-projects hasn’t meaningfully changed in nearly 100 years. Supply chains for today’s infrastructure equipment can’t match the pace and sophistication of critical energy projects. Amperesand is building hardware and software that rewrites this broken power infrastructure playbook to support a new era of energy abundance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;1072&quot;&gt;We’ve built a new class of intelligent, software-defined power infrastructure products leveraging a decade of advanced medium voltage Solid State Transformer research that’s now ready for commercial deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Our products and solutions go far beyond the capabilities of traditional electrical equipment. We make power systems that are faster to deploy, dramatically smaller and more efficient, and capable of supporting modern, dynamic energy needs for tomorrow’s most demanding energy consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1365&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;Scalable in-house advanced manufacturing capability is our foundation for meeting timeline and quality expectation to serve infrastructure customers around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Amperesand is led by breakthrough energy hardware development veterans and funded by top tier investors who share our vision of building a category-defining energy technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;With hubs in San Francisco, Reno, and Singapore, our global team is laser focused on building foundational technology to solve the most pressing problems in power infrastructure at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Join us in building the power foundation of the future!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; Equipment Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop, implement, and optimize preventive and predictive maintenance programs for all production equipment, test systems, and facility assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead troubleshooting and root cause analysis for equipment failures, chronic issues, and performance degradation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure equipment uptime, reliability, and safety to meet production requirements and operational KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with mechanical, electrical, and controls engineering teams to improve equipment design for maintainability and long-term robustness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Oversee maintenance documentation, including work orders, service logs, and equipment history records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calibration &amp;amp; Technical Accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the full calibration program for production tools, measurement devices, sensors, and test equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Define calibration intervals, procedures, and acceptance criteria in collaboration with Quality and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Manage internal and external calibration services, ensuring compliance with industry standards and customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain traceability and documentation for all calibrated assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spare Parts &amp;amp; Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Establish and manage a structured spare parts program, including critical spares identification, stocking strategies, and vendor coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate inventory levels to support uninterrupted production while optimizing cost and storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Oversee asset lifecycle management, including equipment commissioning, decommissioning, and replacement planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work closely with Design Engineering, NPI, Quality, and Production teams to support new equipment introduction and scale-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Participate in equipment FAT/SAT activities and support installation, commissioning, and validation of new machinery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Provide maintenance and calibration input during equipment design reviews and process development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Use data-driven methods to identify trends, reduce downtime, and improve equipment performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead root cause investigations and corrective actions for equipment-related quality or reliability issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive improvements in OEE, equipment health monitoring, and maintenance efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Supervise maintenance technicians and calibration personnel, providing mentorship, training, and technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop team capabilities in troubleshooting, preventive maintenance, and calibration best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to safety protocols, lockout/tagout procedures, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or associate degree in Mechanical, Electrical, Industrial, or Manufacturing Engineering — or equivalent technical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in equipment maintenance, calibration, reliability engineering, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience maintaining complex manufacturing equipment such as automation systems, machining tools, test stations, or power electronics assembly equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with calibration programs, metrology principles, and measurement system accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills and a data-driven approach to problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with maintenance tools and methodologies such as CMMS, TPM, OEE, PFMEA, SPC, and root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to lead cross-functional initiatives and coordinate with vendors and service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
