&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with power electronics manufacturing or high-reliability industries such as automotive, aerospace, semiconductor, or energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Knowledge of mechanical, electrical, and electronic schematics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with motion control, pneumatics, hydraulics, and industrial sensors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with equipment commissioning, FAT/SAT, and capital equipment projects.&lt;/li&gt;
