&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s54mvu&quot; data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3391&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple time zones, deadlines, and complex data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sti9x4&quot; data-start=&quot;3392&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;High level of confidentiality and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
