&lt;li&gt;PTO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;Qualifications for a private duty [RN/LPN]&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
