&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ebury helps ambitious businesses unlock global growth, and we take the same approach with our people. We encourage innovation and movement, collaboration and problem-solving, and foster an environment where everyone can feel they belong, are valued, supported and empowered to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a collaborator who wants to help transform how businesses operate globally, get in touch - we’d love to discuss how Ebury can accelerate your career so you can shape the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FX Sales Lead - Defence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London Victoria - Onsite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ebury is a global FinTech powerhouse. We don’t just move money; we empower international businesses to trade without boundaries. With a suite of products ranging from complex FX risk management and trade finance to integrated API solutions, we are the strategic engine behind some of the world’s most ambitious firms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales lead for Defence, you will lead the charge in this high-stakes vertical, navigating C-suite relationships to deliver sophisticated treasury and hedging solutions. The Defence industry operates on long-term cycles, massive capital outlays, and intricate global supply chains and your approach should reflect this. You aren&#39;t just hitting targets—you are a role model on our London floor, mentoring the next generation of talent and setting the gold standard for how Ebury dominates the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Origination:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and onboard Tier-1 prospects within the Defence and Aerospace sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond &quot;spot trades.&quot; You will sell complex FX hedging strategies, cash management, and trade finance solutions tailored to long-cycle defense contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and leverage high-level relationships with CFOs, Treasurers, and Finance Directors, understanding their specific budgeting and risk appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sector Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the internal &quot;Defence Expert,&quot; providing feedback to Product teams to ensure Ebury’s roadmap remains the best-in-class for this sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellence in Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a rigorous pipeline via Salesforce, ensuring a culture of data-driven sales and superior relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Ebury? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market-Leading Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A competitive base salary with a transparent, uncapped commission structure designed for high-achievers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next-Gen Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to an advanced product suite, including our proprietary API integrations and multi-currency platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Mobility:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities for international bootcamps and visiting one of our global offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast-Track Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A clear growth pathway from individual contributor to a partner in the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from our flagship, modern office in London Victoria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand Defense:&lt;/strong&gt; You can speak the language of &quot;fixed-price bids,&quot; &quot;long-term procurement,&quot; and &quot;sovereign risk.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are a Master Negotiator:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in high-value negotiations and can articulate complex financial concepts to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are a Culture Carrier:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead by example, fostering a competitive yet collaborative environment on the sales floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak Fluent English&lt;/strong&gt; (a second language is a bonus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feel free to reach out directly on LinkedIn - Freddie Mugridge&lt;/p&gt;
